{"words": [{"text": "لَّا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "يَسْتَوِى", "translation": "(are) equal"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَـٰعِدُونَ", "translation": "the ones who sit"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "among"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "the believers"}, {"text": "غَيْرُ", "translation": "other than"}, {"text": "أُو۟لِى", "translation": "the ones (who are)"}, {"text": "ٱلضَّرَرِ", "translation": "[the] disabled"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمُجَـٰهِدُونَ", "translation": "and the ones who strive"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ", "translation": "with their wealth"}, {"text": "وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "and their lives"}, {"text": "فَضَّلَ", "translation": "Preferred"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(has) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ", "translation": "the ones who strive"}, {"text": "بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ", "translation": "with their wealth"}, {"text": "وَأَنفُسِهِمْ", "translation": "and their lives"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ", "translation": "the ones who sit"}, {"text": "دَرَجَةًۭ ۚ", "translation": "(in) rank"}, {"text": "وَكُلًّۭا", "translation": "And (to) all"}, {"text": "وَعَدَ", "translation": "promised"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(has) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ", "translation": "the best"}, {"text": "وَفَضَّلَ", "translation": "preferred"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(has) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ", "translation": "the ones who strive"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ", "translation": "the ones who sit"}, {"text": "أَجْرًا", "translation": "(with) a reward"}, {"text": "عَظِيمًۭا", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "Not equal are those believers remaining [at home] - other than the disabled - and the mujāhideen, [who strive and fight] in the cause of Allāh with their wealth and their lives. Allāh has preferred the mujāhideen through their wealth and their lives over those who remain [behind], by degrees. And to all [i.e., both] Allāh has promised the best [reward]. But Allāh has preferred the mujāhideen over those who remain [behind] with a great reward -"}